{# Functional Role: KnowAct — Generate full registry crate #}
{# Produces: scaffold #}
{# Phase 2 — SCAFFOLD (DO: generate manifest + templates + process manifest + SKILL.md) #}
{# hKask v0.31.0 — Create Skill #}
{#
  Delegates to skill-maintenance-build for the mechanical scaffolding.
